<h2 class="font_3 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px; line-height:normal;"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:18px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></span></h2>

<h2 class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">Looking for professional heat pump installers near you? ATL Heat Pumps experienced team is ready to help. Whether you need a new installation, maintenance, or repairs, we&rsquo;ll provide efficient, reliable service tailored to your needs.</h2>

<h2 class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">&nbsp;</h2>

<h2 class="font_7 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;">Call us today at 0800 555 770, fill out our online enquiry form, or send us an email to schedule your consultation. Let us help make your home or business comfortable year-round with expertly installed Christchurch heat pumps.<br class="wixui-rich-text__text">
&nbsp;</h2></div><div id="comp-km46es4o" class="W4V2qg comp-km46es4o wixui-image"><div data-testid="linkElement" class="apPOZK"><img loading="lazy" sizes="395px" srcSet="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d60bbd_3d8895da54364071ab74966da2d0a4d9~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_0,w_579,h_327/fill/w_395,h_222,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/ATL-are-authorised-Control4-dealers-and-.png 1x, https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d60bbd_3d8895da54364071ab74966da2d0a4d9~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_0,w_579,h_327/fill/w_695,h_390,al_c,lg_1,q_85,enc_avif,quality_auto/ATL-are-authorised-Control4-dealers-and-.png 2x" id="img_comp-km46es4o" src="https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d60bbd_3d8895da54364071ab74966da2d0a4d9~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_0,w_579,h_327/fill/w_395,h_222,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/ATL-are-authorised-Control4-dealers-and-.png" alt="Speak with an ATL heat pump expert" style="object-fit:cover" class="gRkIq0 sFiSiq" width="395" height="222"/></div></div><div class="comp-km46jw87 mu5PoX" id="comp-km46jw87" aria-disabled="false"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.atlelectrical.co.nz/contact" target="_self" class="twJknM wixui-button ZhVEJq" aria-disabled="false" aria-label="SPEAK WITH AN EXPERT"><span class="OR4Nv8 wixui-button__label">SPEAK WITH AN EXPERT</span></a></div></div></div></section><section id="comp-mcs9idj3" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-mcs9idj3 wixui-section" data-block-level-container="ClassicSection"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mcs9idj3" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mcs9idj3" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mcs9idj3" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mcs9idj3" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mcs9idj3inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mcs9idj3inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><section id="comp-mcs9idja" class="comp-mcs9idja CeUMmm wixui-colum